WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:13.700
Hello! I'm Artem, founder of Antonov Digital.
I'll show you how the NFC card for Google reviews works with a live example.

00:13.700 --> 00:23.940
Here is the card. It has adhesive strips,
so you can attach it to a table or a wall.

00:23.940 --> 00:40.880
The customer holds their phone near the card and opens the link.
It takes them straight to the page for leaving a review of your Google listing.

00:40.880 --> 01:05.320
With a QR code, they first open the camera, scan the code,
open the link, then find where to leave a review on the business page.

01:05.320 --> 01:15.760
Here, they hold the phone near the card, tap and open the link —
and can immediately write a review of your business on Google.
